 "note": "Thomas C. Passios Elementary School faculty list, identified by its own title (lines 1-3: 'THOMAS C. PASSIOS ELEMENTARY SCHOOL / FACULTY / 2001 - 2002'). Line 39 is the page number. Layout: two columns, each a label and a name (Textract x 0.03/0.15 and 0.39/0.57 or similar). The left-column office labels (Principal, Asst. Prin., Adm. Sec., Guidance, Nurse) are titles and go in role_raw; the grade labels (Preschool, Kindergarten, Grade 1-4) and every right-column label (Learning Center, Art, Cafeteria, Custodians ...) are section labels governing the names below them and go in grade_or_dept. A cell printing two names with '/' is two entries. '(Pri.)' after a name is kept in role_raw as printed (it marks the Primary School). Line 9's Sharon Massie continues the Nurse block. Tara Herrick is printed twice (Phys. Ed. line 15, Chapter 1 line 23); both recorded."
